# GraphGantt

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphGantt } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphGantt
  title="example"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `items` | `GanttItem[]` | `—` | — |
| `ticks?` | `string[]` | `—` | — |
| `columns?` | `number` | `24` | — |
| `stage?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `progress?` | `number` | `—` | — |
| `glyphs?` | `Glyphs` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GanttItem`
- `GraphGanttProps`
